===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of many [[herb]]s, of the [[genus]] ''[[Ranunculus]]'', having [[yellow]] [[flower]]s; the [[crowfoot]].
# Any [[flower]] of the genus ''[[Narcissus]]''; a [[daffodil]]
# {{non-gloss definition|Affectionate or ironic term of address.}}
#* {{quote-text|year=1987|author=Joyce Brandon|title=Lady and the Lawman|page=346|passage=Listen, '''buttercup''', you're damned good in bed. They don't come any better, but I'm really not interested in playing second fiddle to your camera or your young lovers.}}

